\pard\li2880\sl240\slmult1\ulnone\b0 This specification defines a JSON [RFC4627] structure which allows a JSON value to reference another value in a JSON document.  This provides the basis for transclusion in JSON: the use of a target resource as an effective substitute for the reference.\par
\{ "$ref": "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://example.com/example.json#/foo/bar"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 http://example.com/example.json#/foo/bar}}}\f0\fs22 " \}\par
The "$ref" string value contains a URI [{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3986"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf1 https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3986}}}\f0\fs22 ], which identifies the location of the JSON value being referenced. \ul\b\par
